<title>GREECE: Greece auctions 125bln drs of 7-yr FRNs Jul 29.</title>
<headline>Greece auctions 125bln drs of 7-yr FRNs Jul 29.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece auctions 125 billion drachmas of seven-year floaters on Tuesday setting the first coupon at 10.40 percent.</p>
<p>The first coupon is based on the 12-month T-bill rate, currently at 9.60 percent, plus a spread of 0.80 percent.</p>
<p>The ministry has the right to accept non-competitive bids up to 30 percent of the auctioned amount. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
